Package: httk
Version: 2.7.3
Date: 2025-11-25
Title: High-Throughput Toxicokinetics
Description: This is a modified version of the EPA's 'httk' R package (v2.7.3)
             (github.com/USEPA/CompTox-ExpoCast-httk).
             This version of 'httk' removes the use of
             global variables within the package. A new function argument 
             'chemdata' was added to many functions and its default value was set
             to httk's 'chem.physical_and_invitro.data' data frame. If a user
             needs to add new chemicals to simulate, a new data frame
             (original chem.physical_and_invitro.data plus rows with new chemicals)
             can be just passed through the function instead of using the global 
             environment to store it. The remaining variables originally defined
             as 'global' have been made available as internal data sets. No
             algorithms have been changed from the original 'httk' package.
